    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PS - This is the 4th Greatest Game Ever Made, in existence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">My Top 4 List is as follows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1. My Diablo 2 Resurrected Mod - (I'm responsible for that mod) Tal Rasha Prime is the Apex of gaming #1. The Ultimate dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2. Magic The Gathering: Shandalar by Microprose, is #2.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3. Anarchy Online by old FunCom, is #3</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4. My game RogueStone is #4. You know sht fk so go away, your opinion is dgsht! Get fk out of my reviews, you piece of turd.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I made a Mobile Game recently that I think may go into the #2 spot beating out Shandalar. Its a Hero Collector GACHA set in a Cyberpunk Theme, where Magic is Psionics, with Boss Raids, and Faction reputation system, with a Food System, and a Item Upgrade system, very deep game, Battles are Automated, so its sort of idle-like. The game's been completed 100% but remains unpublished by me, since Im busy with other things in life. Best way to keep in touch with my work, is to follow Tal Rasha Prime mod pack, for Diablo 2 Resurrected on Nexus mods</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tal Rasha Prime (Where I hang out on #1 Greatest Game Ever, It's the Apex def!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Visit Nexus mods (search for Tal Rasha Prime)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do NOT Leave a Review on a Dead Game. I know you get emotional about this game when playing it since it is Hard, and do NOT appreciate the Positives. This game is misunderstood since the audience that this game attracted was the Wrong Kind, It's FREE Now so why are you leaving a Sad Review when this Game is Dead. You DID NOT PAY FOR IT! Go Away! This Game to me the Developer is AMAZING! I rank my own Game VERY HIGH and I know every game that Exist. This Game if more Existed like it would be more Acceptable. This game was made on a very Tiny Budget, before A.i.. This game would be Different if it had Custom Assets but that doesn't matter to me as a Developer it's Strengths is it attempted to create a New Kind of RPG. But, the audience it attracted killed it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955990/extras/ae10bc9eed31d2323538c95b7c6296af.poster.avif?t=1754346926\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955990/extras/ae10bc9eed31d2323538c95b7c6296af.webm?t=1754346926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955990/extras/ae10bc9eed31d2323538c95b7c6296af.mp4?t=1754346926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
